OL,3,GNEWSAFirm gets #2.5m MOD radiation     
OL,4,Adetector contract                      
OL,6,FA firm has been commissioned to make   
OL,7,Fwearable radiation detectors for       
OL,8,Fmilitary staff as part of a #2.5m      
OL,9,Fcontract.                              
OL,11,FThe Ministry of Defence (MOD) has      
OL,12,Fcommissioned Kromek Group plc, based in
OL,13,FSedgefield, County Durham, to make the 
OL,14,Fequipment, which detects nuclear and   
OL,15,Fradiological threats.                  
OL,17,FThe company previously made radiation  
OL,18,Fdevices for dogs, to be used in        
OL,19,FUkraine.                               
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
