OL,3,GNEWSAFirm gets #2.5m MOD radiation     
OL,4,Adetector contract                      
OL,6,FKromek said the technology, originally 
OL,7,Fdeveloped under a programme with the US
OL,8,FDepartment of Defence, was designed for
OL,9,Fuse in "challenging military and       
OL,10,Fsecurity environments".                
